{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Crop your photos! 是一款專為自製護照及證件相而設的手機應用，讓你在家中直接以智能手機完成剪裁、去背與存檔，毋須前往影樓。適合需要辦理護照、身份證、駕駛執照或簽證等官方文件的用戶。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>智能剪裁與自動去背</h2>\n<p>Crop your photos! 提供智能剪裁，選取臉部後自動置中，並以剪影引導正確擺放頭肩，減少常見錯誤。內建多國標準證件相尺寸，涵蓋意大利、美國、英國、加拿大、印度與歐盟等，亦可自訂。自動去背可快速移除背景，做出符合規定的純色底，完成後可儲存至相簿或分享。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-81-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-82-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-83-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-84-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-85-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Crop your photos!</li>\n<li>應用類別：Utilities</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-12T13:59:33.573217+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":312,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}